      "content": "i don't think i can find that \"authenticity\" you're talking about. every time i try, i just realize that the version of me that actually fits into this family is a version that doesn't exist. i'm just a ghost haunting a legacy that doesn't want me. wouldn't it be more poetic, more selfless, if i just faded away? like, instead of being this constant source of disappointment that they have to deal with, i just... remove the problem. wouldn't the family be better off if the stain was just gone?",
